/earthwandering/28190449331/","height":2299,"id":"28190449331","kind":"photo","license":"All Rights Reserved","original":"originals/28190449331/28190449331_d8920f6856_o.jpg","sha256":"d1a99176fc82208657ff99789022c5ca8e4afa0e9b14bc58262d49cccf07a777","tags":["portland","oregon"],"taken":"2016-06-14 21:03:33","title":"IMG_6003","uploaded":"2016-07-12 11:34:27","width":3740},"28190450881":{"albums":[{"id":"72157643911711523","position":6220}],"bytes":3652089,"camera_position":6220,"comments":[{"author":"50167308@N06","date":"2016-07-14 12:28:21","text":"Definitely you did! And it influenced my generation a lot. E.g. 'Patriotism' is a thing I see very critical. Did I start a political discussion now ..?"},{"author":"100330886@N04","date":"2016-07-14 22:05:35","text":"There is a lot of cynicism about patriotism here too, but the strength of the cynicism seems to come and go like the tide.  In our weakest, most doubtful moments, it seems that a cliche nostalgia for moments that shed us in a more positive light comes up.  I bet Newsweek has a team of people working on this same issue continuously (my cynicism).  There won't be a \"special edition\" on drone warfare.\n\nIf it didn't come through in my comment correctly, please take the, \"Don't let us forget to tell you...\" with a skeptical wink.  Thank you for your comment, it is very interesting getting to talk to people around the world and be inspired by their pictures of daily life.  Germany will be visited on a bike tour!  Hopefully sooner rather than later."},{"author":"50167308@N06","date":"2016-07-15 00:09:29","text":"We have a spare bed available ...\n:-)"},{"author":"100330886@N04","date":"2016-07-15 06:12:38","text":"Nice! :)"}],"description":"The American obsession with World War II.  Don't let us forget to tell you we did something right once or twice.","detail":"photos/0105.json","filename":"28190450881_5a99156062_o.jpg","flickr_url":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/earthwandering/28190450881/","height":2735,"